{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "斯戴拉警告谢灵统一口径  (Stella Warns Xie Ling on PR Discipline)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "stella": "斯戴拉",
    "xie_ling": "谢灵"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping smoothly into the hallway to defuse the confrontation, PR chief Stella introduces herself to Xie Ling and lays down Xingtian's strict public-relations rules. Listen to Stella and Xie Ling in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "谢总，还没正式介绍过我自己吧？公关部斯戴拉，您好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天如今已经是大公司了，高层人事变动对外界来说很敏感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "根据我们公关部得到的标准说法，您并不是公司的副总裁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "所以千万要跟我们公关部统一口径，不然这种事很容易引起误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天最注重公关形象，谢先生要是在外面乱讲话惹了事故，是要承担责任的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "还有，郁董事长虽然是女的，杀伐决断起来比男人还厉害。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "根据公司规定，公关事故最严重的可以直接开除。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "别说我今天没提前提醒您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你叫什么来着？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我什么身份啊，犯得着跟你们一般见识吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "咱们来日方长！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "谢总，还没正式介绍过我自己吧？公关部斯戴拉，您好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Mr Xie, I do not believe I have formally introduced myself yet—Stella from Public Relations, hello.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天如今已经是大公司了，高层人事变动对外界来说很敏感。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian is a major corporation now, and senior personnel changes are sensitive in the public eye.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "根据我们公关部得到的标准说法，您并不是公司的副总裁。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'According to the official line given to our PR department, you are not a company vice president.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "所以千万要跟我们公关部统一口径，不然这种事很容易引起误会。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So please keep your messaging strictly aligned with PR, or this could easily cause misunderstandings.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天最注重公关形象，谢先生要是在外面乱讲话惹了事故，是要承担责任的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian prizes its public image above all; if Mr Xie speaks carelessly outside and sparks a PR incident, you will be held accountable.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "还有，郁董事长虽然是女的，杀伐决断起来比男人还厉害。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Besides, although our chairwoman is a woman, she is even more decisive and ruthless than any man.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "根据公司规定，公关事故最严重的可以直接开除。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Under company rules, the most serious public-relations violations carry immediate dismissal.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "别说我今天没提前提醒您。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not say I failed to warn you in advance today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你叫什么来着？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Remind me what your name was again?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我什么身份啊，犯得着跟你们一般见识吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'With someone of my stature, why would I stoop to your level?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "咱们来日方长！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We have plenty of days ahead to settle scores!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "谢总，还没正式介绍过我自己吧？公关部斯戴拉，您好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天如今已经是大公司了，高层人事变动对外界来说很敏感。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "根据我们公关部得到的标准说法，您并不是公司的副总裁。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "所以千万要跟我们公关部统一口径，不然这种事很容易引起误会。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "星天最注重公关形象，谢先生要是在外面乱讲话惹了事故，是要承担责任的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "还有，郁董事长虽然是女的，杀伐决断起来比男人还厉害。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "根据公司规定，公关事故最严重的可以直接开除。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "别说我今天没提前提醒您。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你叫什么来着？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我什么身份啊，犯得着跟你们一般见识吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "咱们来日方长！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Backed by Xingtian's zero-tolerance dismissal policy for PR blunders, Stella leaves a rattled Xie Ling muttering threats under his breath as he retreats. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
